ogic and observation skills to get through the riddles.\n\nGather ingredients, find the right recipe and brew alchemical potions.\n\nBut as you follow the trail to complete your adventure, you sense something is wrong. A truth buried under layers of alchemical lies...\n\nAre you willing to do whatever it takes to claim a soul of your own?", "summary": "First-person adventure game, playable solo or co-op with up to 4 people. Travel through unique areas, uncover memories and use them to craft powerful potions. Unlock special abilities and solve puzzles in a mysterious world. Will your soul survive this journey?", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/alchemist-journey-of-the-soul", "videos": [{"id": 184746, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "WbIcYBfOj6U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WbIcYBfOj6U", "title": "Alchemist: Journey of the Soul - Official Gameplay Trailer | Multiplayer puzzle game", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WbIcYBfOj6U/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 184747, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "OlXjW4X0u8E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OlXjW4X0u8E", "title": "Alchemist: Journey of the Soul | Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OlXjW4X0u8E/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 188401, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "sdBpT2S0uFw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sdBpT2S0uFw", "title": "Alchemist: Journey of the Soul - Launch Trailer | PS5 & PS4 Games", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sdBpT2S0uFw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}